@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Approved Purchase Requests

DEVELOPER OWNER: Amal
MODULE: Sourcing Officer / Tender Management
TRELLO TASK: Approved Purchase Requests
TRELLO URL: https://trello.com/c/bsQzN4ih

PURPOSE:
Officer’s request inbox: Submitted requests to review and
Accepted requests that a tender can be created from.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Sourcing Officer

ROUTE: /SourcingOfficer/PurchaseRequests

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Query PurchaseRequests with Status Submitted or Accepted,
  newest first.
- Row actions: Review (Submitted) and Create tender
  (Accepted without a tender).

DEPENDENCIES:
PurchaseRequests, Departments, Tenders.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
A tender can only be created from an Accepted request.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Approved Purchase Requests";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "Requests";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Requests waiting for your review and accepted requests ready for a tender.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="pg-toolbar" aria-label="Search and filters">
    <input type="search" placeholder="Search requests" aria-label="Search requests" disabled />
    <select aria-label="Status" disabled><option>Status: Submitted (to review)</option><option>Status: Accepted (ready for tender)</option><option>Status: Returned</option><option>Status: Rejected</option></select>
    <select aria-label="Department" disabled><option>Department: All</option></select>
    <span class="pg-hint">Search and filters are not implemented yet.</span>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-purchase-requests">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-purchase-requests">Purchase requests</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Reference</th><th scope="col">Title</th><th scope="col">Department</th><th scope="col">Priority</th><th scope="col">Needed by</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Actions</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="7"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No purchase requests are loaded yet."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<aside class="pg-note"><strong>Two kinds of rows</strong><p>Submitted requests open the Review page (built by Doulat). Accepted requests show a Create tender action (built by Amal).</p></aside>

<nav class="pg-links" aria-label="Related pages">
    <ul>
        <li><a asp-area="SourcingOfficer" asp-controller="PurchaseRequests" asp-action="Review">Review a request</a></li>
        <li><a asp-area="SourcingOfficer" asp-controller="Tenders" asp-action="Create">Create tender</a></li>
    </ul>
</nav>
